{"steam_appid":3031880,"steam_name":"Car Park Capital","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3031880/1861820953/a38369c27bc451b6c2f126c22b3fdc811efa8755/1791484087/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1791539736","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257452930/e88207f7b7a62197bb3a33a52a21cff673348e18/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1791539736","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031880/6b35c5a545c50de96aac8039d86d96f171e76cca/ss_6b35c5a545c50de96aac8039d86d96f171e76cca.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791662175","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031880/cb6c6697aae69ac30fc00687adf07a1c2c87d86b/ss_cb6c6697aae69ac30fc00687adf07a1c2c87d86b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791662175","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031880/31f6c384f4f1398e7c825e6cdebb48c2839c86b8/ss_31f6c384f4f1398e7c825e6cdebb48c2839c86b8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791662175","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031880/a55130b45e4a8e44b29136defcf87a91e27f495c/ss_a55130b45e4a8e44b29136defcf87a91e27f495c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791662175","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031880/c229c566cce314a685d166754abffeceb2b7fb0c/ss_c229c566cce314a685d166754abffeceb2b7fb0c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791662175"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031880/extras/4fcd4a859c1bd118e885e1a14aa8b91c.avif?t=1791662175\" width=369 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You've been hired by Big Auto to unleash the <strong>Freedom of Car Dependency</strong> on unsuspecting townsfolk!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Design the slickest parking lots ever seen, then convince citizens they absolutely <i>need</i> them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Spread glossy pro-car propaganda, outsmart those pesky anti-petrol protesters, and transform quiet neighborhoods into your parking empire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">It's time to drive up car sales and oil consumption! For profit.. but mostly for freedom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031880/extras/c5e336634266bcc4fcd25421db4e8101.poster.avif?t=1791662175\" width=360 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031880/extras/c5e336634266bcc4fcd25421db4e8101.webm?t=1791662175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031880/extras/c5e336634266bcc4fcd25421db4e8101.mp4?t=1791662175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031880/extras/f9befd2b01f5ffcd149de74f9336b8d7.poster.avif?t=1791662175\" width=360 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031880/extras/f9befd2b01f5ffcd149de74f9336b8d7.webm?t=1791662175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031880/extras/f9befd2b01f5ffcd149de74f9336b8d7.mp4?t=1791662175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031880/extras/e1fc7451e9cfc7fc3b327581a05ab9cb.avif?t=1791662175\" width=369 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031880/extras/33d86da8111f66ffce7b8c2b74698422.poster.avif?t=1791662175\" width=780 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031880/extras/33d86da8111f66ffce7b8c2b74698422.webm?t=1791662175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031880/extras/33d86da8111f66ffce7b8c2b74698422.mp4?t=1791662175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031880/extras/c8662c0e17958ec0ee753a249a8a37f7.avif?t=1791662175\" width=369 height=78 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time simulation</strong> with hundreds of vehicles and (bald) citizens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy land, demolish homes, and build the parking lots of your dreams: Endless flat seas of asphalt or build into the air using the <strong>3D construction tools.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Read anyone's thoughts</strong>: Are they embracing cars yet, or annoyed by your ever-increasing parking fees and the sight of your oil drills?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>pro-car propaganda</strong> to turn everyone into a carbrain. Place shiny statues, billboard posters, and blast catchy slogans from megaphones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep the people somewhat happy</strong>: If traffic is a mess, distract them with a ride on your glorious Ferris Wheel for cars!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control the anti-car protests</strong> before they shatter your reputation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track everything in the <strong>Stat-o-matic</strong>: A true tycoon loves watching numbers go up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drill for oil</strong>. A full tank is a full heart.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rival public transport</strong>: You don't want trains or walkable towns, you want every space flooded with cars! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031880/extras/e6a4f9b9a6b938221edab4e27d3e1ec2.avif?t=1791662175\" width=369 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Car Park Capital fuses strategy and simulation with satire, offering social commentary on car dependency and urban development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Become a real tycoon and start paving your automotive paradise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 4.2+<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 4.2+<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Indie","Simulation","Strategy","Early Access"],"developers":["Hilkojj Interactive"],"publishers":["MicroProse Software"],"release_date":"9 Oct, 2026"}